background:#EFC\"><i>A sceptre containing multiple charges of <a href=\"/page/Greater_Teleport\" title=\"Greater Teleport\">Greater Teleport</a>. This spell can instantly transport you and your party to a variety of far flung locations. You will need to enter a private instance to use this spell.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/page/File:Greater_Teleport_destinations.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Greater_Teleport_destinations.png/300px-Greater_Teleport_destinations.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"342\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Greater_Teleport_destinations.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption>The Greater Teleport destination selection screen</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/page/Greater_Teleport\" title=\"Greater Teleport\">Greater Teleport</a> Destinations:</b>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Zawabi%27s_Refuge\" title=\"Zawabi&#39;s Refuge\">Zawabi's Refuge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/The_Restless_Isles\" title=\"The Restless Isles\">The Restless Isles</a> (party arrives at <a href=\"/page/The_Foothold\" title=\"The Foothold\">The Foothold</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Twilight_Forge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Twilight Forge\">The Twilight Forge</a> (party arrives at The Foothold if the caster has never been to The Twilight Forge)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Gianthold\" title=\"Gianthold\">Gianthold</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/The_Necropolis\" title=\"The Necropolis\">The Necropolis</a> (Upper)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/The_Portable_Hole\" title=\"The Portable Hole\">The Portable Hole</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Meridia\" title=\"Meridia\">Meridia</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224836\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.140 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3870/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25280/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7272/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n115.23%  139.668     44 Template:IO\n100.00%  121.206      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  121.206      1 -total\n 95.42%  115.652      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 41.34%   50.107      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.00%   47.272      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 37.16%   45.040      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 36.37%   44.086      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.95%   22.970      1 Template:Non-food\n 16.63%   20.161      1 Template:Red\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:48096-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817224836 and revision id 659192. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
